# .env  Description

ALLOWED_DEV_ORIGINS= - Comma-separated list of allowed development domains

DATABASE_URL= - Database connection string (replace with your actual provider credentials)

CALLBACK_URL= callback URL for OAuth redirection
AUTH_SECRET= - Secret key for authentication encryption
AUTH_DISCORD_ID= - Discord OAuth application ID
AUTH_DISCORD_SECRET= - Discord OAuth application secret

YUKASSA_SHOP_ID= - Yandex.Kassa payment gateway shop ID
YUKASSA_SECRET_KEY= - Yandex.Kassa API key for payment processing

DCD_SECRET= - Secret key for DCD integration
DCD_HOST= - Host URL for DCD service

**Setup:** Copy this file to `.env` and fill in your actual values for local development.